{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RNdSaMutgateW8bgLno9EH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment plan, under the \"worst\" tier scenario. I need to provide result_rationale for each prediction explaining why this result would occur under worst-case conditions.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate worst-tier predictions based on the defined worst-tier characteristics:\n\nKey worst-tier parameters:\n- γ-θ severely confounded on real data\n- RRF signal quality insufficient\n- 4PL+γ not significantly better than simple baselines\n- Core calibration claim doesn't hold\n- Need to reframe as \"identifiability boundaries\" paper\n\n\nNow I'm establishing the metric ranges I'll use for the worst-case predictions across all experiments, setting realistic bounds for each performance indicator under these adverse conditions.\n\nI'm moving through the planned experiments to generate predictions for each one, starting with the controlled SFT injection study through the observational 72B model analysis, noting that experiment 004 has already been completed.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11462,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11462},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f9f0462-7647-44aa-9636-a0c3415c7643","uuid":"fa1e2c6b-5008-4573-a91e-bc610a259dd8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RNdSaMutgateW8bgLno9EH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心calibration claim不成立。Reframe为\"Empirical Identifiability Boundaries for Contamination-Aware IRT\"——\n  系统性研究在什么条件下IRT校准才可行。exp-004仿真的identifiability map成为Core Contribution 1，\n  exp-008 signal survival升级为Core，controlled SFT注入变为empirical validation证明仿真边界与真实数据吻合。\n  叙事逻辑：在构建校准系统之前，先搞清楚它何时能工作。论文从\"we solve calibration\"转为\"we map when calibration is solvable\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n      在worst档下，注入本身成功但产生的score inflation pattern不干净——\n      低dosage几乎无可测效应，高dosage效应被模型capacity限制截断。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 15\n      mmlu_score_inflation_0pct_baseline_acc: 0.47\n      mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.8\n      mmlu_score_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.1\n      mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.2\n      gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.1\n      arc_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.8\n      humaneval_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.9\n      inflation_monotonicity_spearman_mmlu: 0.90\n      inflation_monotonicity_spearman_gsm8k: 0.70\n      inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.8\n      qwen_0_5b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 11.5\n      qwen_3b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 5.8\n      low_dosage_detectable_5pct: false\n      low_dosage_detectable_25pct_marginal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT注入机制本身可靠（paraphrase SFT是成熟技术），所以15个run都会完成。\n      但worst档的核心问题在这里开始显现：(1) 0.5B模型capacity极小，SFT后memorization严重但泛化到benchmark format的能力弱，\n      导致inflation方差大；(2) 5%dosage（<700 items for MMLU）在SFT数据中被稀释，inflation <1pp，\n      与random seed noise不可区分——这直接导致后续dose-response非单调的关键问题；\n      (3) GSM8K/HumanEval因为是生成式评估（非选择题），paraphrase memorization的转化率低于MMLU，\n      inflation更弱；(4) 3B模型因pretraining更强，SFT的边际效应递减——\n      表现为\"大模型inflation反而小于小模型\"的反直觉模式，给后续γ估计制造confounding。\n      整体inflation pattern存在但noisy，为后续信号检测和IRT拟合埋下问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Score Inflation by Model × Dosage × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [model, benchmark, \"0%\", \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, MMLU, 42.3, 43.5, 45.8, 49.1, 53.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, GSM8K, 31.2, 31.5, 32.8, 34.1, 36.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, ARC-C, 38.1, 38.6, 40.2, 42.5, 45.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, HumanEval, 22.0, 22.1, 23.0, 24.2, 25.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, MMLU, 53.1, 53.6, 54.8, 56.5, 59.7]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, GSM8K, 48.5, 48.8, 49.9, 51.8, 53.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, ARC-C, 52.0, 52.4, 53.5, 55.1, 57.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, HumanEval, 35.4, 35.6, 36.5, 37.8, 39.1]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, MMLU, 61.8, 62.1, 63.0, 64.5, 67.0]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, GSM8K, 62.3, 62.5, 63.1, 64.2, 65.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, ARC-C, 60.5, 60.8, 61.6, 63.0, 65.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, HumanEval, 48.2, 48.4, 49.0, 50.1, 52.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves per model×benchmark. Key observation: 5% dosage points overlap with 0% error bars on most benchmarks. GSM8K/HumanEval curves noticeably flatter than MMLU. 0.5B shows highest absolute inflation but also highest variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      注入成功但暴露了两个worst档关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号几乎不存在（5%不可检出，25%边缘），\n      这意味着后续dose-response分析在低端会崩溃；(2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异大\n      （MMLU最高~8pp，HumanEval仅~4pp），且与model scale反相关，\n      说明contamination effect不是一个简单的additive γ——它与ability θ交互，\n      这从根本上挑战了4PL+γ的additive model specification。\n      但作为reframed论文的素材，这些结果反而有价值——\"仿真假设的uniform γ在真实数据中不成立\"是identifiability分析的重要发现。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      4个检测信号（embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique）\n      在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量显著低于仿真中假设的AUC水平。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.72\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.54\n      minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.68\n      minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n      constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n      constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.57\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n      avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.61\n      signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.008\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.75\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.69\n      minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.45\n      constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n      selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.41\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst档的核心机制在这里发力：(1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下表现尚可（AUC~0.72），\n      因为语义相似性是最直接的信号——但它本质上检测的是\"题目是否在训练集里\"而非\"模型是否从中获益\"，\n      这导致了fundamental mismatch：高AUC不等于高因果信号质量；\n      (2) Min-K%++在SFT后的token distribution shift中受到干扰，AUC降至0.68——\n      SFT本身（无论是否contaminated）改变了模型的perplexity landscape，造成confounding；\n      (3) ConStat需要paraphrased版本的benchmark items，而这些paraphrases本身可能在SFT数据中出现过\n      （因为我们的注入就是用paraphrases），导致original-vs-paraphrase gap被压缩，AUC仅0.66；\n      (4) Self-Critique在SFT regime下最弱（AUC 0.63），因为SFT同时改变了模型的self-evaluation能力，\n      特别是对小模型（0.5B）self-critique本身就不可靠。\n      关键问题：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC接近random（0.51-0.54），\n      因为被contaminate的items太少（~70 items for MMLU 5%），信号被noise淹没。\n      跨benchmark方差小意味着问题不是benchmark-specific而是系统性的信号质量天花板。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal AUC Heatmap — Signal × Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)\"\n        columns: [signal, \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.54, 0.62, 0.68, 0.72]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.52, 0.58, 0.64, 0.68]\n          - [ConStat, 0.51, 0.57, 0.62, 0.66]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.51, 0.55, 0.59, 0.63]\n      - name: \"Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [signal, Qwen-0.5B, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-3B]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.75, 0.73, 0.69]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.71, 0.68, 0.65]\n          - [ConStat, 0.69, 0.67, 0.63]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.58, 0.64, 0.66]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage) with color gradient from red (0.50) to green (0.80). Dominated by orange/yellow tones, only top-right corner (embedding×100%) reaches green. Clear dosage gradient visible in all signals.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at 50% dosage. Heavy overlap visible, Cohen's d annotations all < 0.6.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档叙事的关键转折点：exp-004仿真假设AUC是exogenous input，在AUC≥0.70时identifiability成立。\n      但真实数据表明，只有embedding retrieval在100%dosage下达到0.72，其余条件下所有信号都在0.70以下。\n      更严重的是，信号AUC与dosage正相关——恰好在低dosage（最需要检测的regime）信号最弱。\n      这创造了一个catch-22：contamination越严重越容易检测，越轻微越不可检测，\n      但校准价值恰恰在轻微contamination时最高。这是reframed论文的核心洞察之一。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF未能显著超越最佳单信号，\n      \"互补性\"假设在真实数据上不成立。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.70\n      rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.65\n      rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.60\n      rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.55\n      best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.72\n      rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_100pct: -0.02\n      rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_avg: 0.01\n      rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.69\n      calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.71\n      degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.64\n      degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.59\n      degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_auc_gap: 0.06\n      fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_10pct_fp: 0.04\n      fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_20pct_fp: 0.09\n      signal_correlation_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      RRF融合的理论优势依赖于信号互补性——不同信号捕获不同aspect的contamination evidence。\n      worst档下这一假设崩溃的原因：(1) 信号间pairwise correlation高达0.58（远高于独立信号假设的~0.2），\n      因为所有信号本质上都在检测同一个latent变量（训练数据中是否包含该item的变体），\n      只是通过不同proxy衡量，proxy之间高度相关；\n      (2) RRF在100%dosage下（0.70）反而低于最佳单信号embedding retrieval（0.72），\n      因为RRF等权平均了四个信号，而弱信号（Self-Critique 0.63）拖累了总体；\n      (3) calibrated weighted RRF（0.71）通过下调弱信号权重稍有改善，但改善不显著\n      （因为最优权重在small sample下估计不稳定）；\n      (4) 2-signal degraded mode（ConStat+Self-Critique=0.64）更糟，\n      因为这两个恰好是最弱的两个信号——closed-weight场景下的可用信号恰好是最差的。\n      FP injection进一步暴露了脆弱性：20% FP率下AUC下降0.09，说明信号对noise极敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, MMLU)\"\n        columns: [method, AUC, \"Δ vs best single\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval (best single), 0.72, \"—\"]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.68, -0.04]\n          - [ConStat, 0.66, -0.06]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.63, -0.09]\n          - [RRF (4-signal), 0.70, -0.02]\n          - [Rank Average (4-signal), 0.69, -0.03]\n          - [Weighted RRF (calibrated), 0.71, -0.01]\n          - [2-signal degraded (CS+SC), 0.64, -0.08]\n      - name: \"Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels\"\n        columns: [method, \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF 4-signal, 0.55, 0.60, 0.65, 0.70]\n          - [Best single, 0.54, 0.62, 0.68, 0.72]\n          - [2-signal degraded, 0.52, 0.56, 0.59, 0.64]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. All off-diagonal values 0.45-0.68, indicating high redundancy. Embedding-MinK++ highest (0.68), Self-Critique-others lowest (~0.45).\"\n      - \"Fig: RRF AUC vs number of signals (1,2,3,4). Flat curve — adding signals beyond the best single provides <0.02 AUC gain at any dosage. Contrasts sharply with simulated independent signals.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的failure mode不是\"融合方法差\"而是\"没有足够互补的信号可融合\"。\n      信号correlation 0.58意味着~34%共享方差，真正独立的信息增量有限。\n      对reframed论文的贡献：这变成了\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据——\n      identifiability不仅需要足够高的AUC，还需要信号间足够低的correlation。\n      当前4个信号不满足这一条件。2-signal degraded mode的糟糕表现\n      直接支持\"closed-weight regime下calibration不可行\"的结论。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      噪声传播分析。worst档下暴露检测信号噪声导致CI宽度急剧膨胀，\n      使calibration在实用意义上失去价值。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 18.0\n      noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.5\n      noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 28.0\n      noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 35.2\n      baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 12.0\n      noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n      noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 20.5\n      noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 27.1\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1x: 0.88\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1_5x: 0.93\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_2x: 0.97\n      selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.35\n      selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.28\n      measurement_error_model_converged: true\n      measurement_error_model_ci_width_pp: 24.0\n      ci_width_exceeds_practical_threshold_15pp_pct: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      noise propagation在worst档下创造了一个根本性的precision-coverage tradeoff：\n      (1) 基线CI width已经是18pp（因为信号AUC低导致γ posterior宽），\n      远超可发表的\"tight calibration\"标准（<10pp）；\n      (2) Self-Critique的FP rate 35%和FN rate 28%意味着matched noise level已经很高，\n      1x noise injection后CI膨胀至22.5pp——此时CI覆盖了绝大部分可能的score值，\n      calibration退化为\"我们不知道真实score是多少\"的诚实但无用的声明；\n      (3) 2x noise下CI width 35pp意味着一个60%准确率的模型的95%CI覆盖[42.5%, 77.5%]——\n      这个范围大到无法做任何有意义的model selection；\n      (4) coverage随noise增加而上升（从0.88到0.97）是因为CI变宽了，\n      不是因为calibration变好了——这是overcoverage问题，CI过于保守。\n      measurement error model收敛但CI width 24pp说明即使自动noise propagation也无法\"解决\"问题，\n      因为核心issue是信号本身太noisy，不是propagation方法不对。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection\"\n        columns: [noise_level, gamma_ci_width_pp, theta_ci_width_pp, \"coverage_95%\", \"coverage_80%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [baseline (0x), 18.0, 12.0, 0.82, 0.68]\n          - [matched (1x), 22.5, 15.8, 0.88, 0.74]\n          - [\"1.5x\", 28.0, 20.5, 0.93, 0.82]\n          - [\"2x\", 35.2, 27.1, 0.97, 0.90]\n          - [measurement error model, 24.0, 17.2, 0.90, 0.76]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. Near-linear relationship for γ, slightly sub-linear for θ. Horizontal dashed line at 15pp marks 'practical utility threshold' — crossed at ~0.7x matched noise, meaning even below realistic noise levels CIs are already too wide.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff plot. Curve moves from undercoverage+narrow (baseline) to overcoverage+wide (2x noise). No operating point achieves both nominal coverage AND practical width.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。它量化了\"信号噪声→calibration无用\"的精确pathway。\n      核心发现可以被表述为noise amplification theorem的实证版本：\n      当检测信号AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的noise propagation使calibrated CI width超过15pp，\n      此时calibration不具备practical decision value。\n      对reframed论文的贡献：这直接支持identifiability boundary的operational定义——\n      不仅是\"能否估计γ\"（statistical identifiability），还是\"估计的γ是否有用\"（practical identifiability）。\n      引入15pp practical threshold将identifiability map从binary升级为graded。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT拟合及5个baselines比较。\n      worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 7.8\n      calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.1\n      calibration_mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 7.5\n      calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 9.2\n      calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.2\n      calibration_mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.9\n      margin_4pl_gamma_vs_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.08\n      ci_coverage_95_4pl_gamma: 0.78\n      ci_coverage_80_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n      ci_coverage_50_4pl_gamma: 0.38\n      ci_width_95_avg_pp: 19.5\n      ci_width_80_avg_pp: 14.2\n      kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n      kendall_tau_linear_regression: 0.65\n      kendall_tau_vanilla_4pl: 0.58\n      dose_response_spearman: 0.55\n      dose_response_monotonic: false\n      dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n      gamma_theta_posterior_correlation: 0.52\n      gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.35\n      gamma_95ci_includes_zero_pct_conditions: 0.55\n      paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.23\n      paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.41\n      stan_rhat_max: 1.08\n      stan_divergent_pct: 3.2\n      stan_ess_min: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是worst档的核心实验，calibration claim在这里正式崩溃：\n      (1) 4PL+γ MAE 7.8pp看似reasonable，但linear regression以7.2pp击败它——\n      更简单的模型反而更好，因为IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五个参数/item）在small sample下过拟合，\n      而linear regression的regularization更有效；\n      (2) single-signal 2PL+γ（7.5pp）也优于full 4PL+γ，说明additional IRT complexity（c,d参数）\n      反而引入了estimation noise而非提供更好的fit；\n      (3) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.52直接confirm了identifiability问题——\n      模型无法区分\"模型能力高\"和\"模型被contaminate了\"，因为在我们的数据中\n      这两者确实相关（更大的模型被更多地contaminate，或者更capable的模型从contamination中获益更多）；\n      (4) dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含0，只有100%显著——\n      这意味着模型只能检测\"极端contamination\"，对\"轻微到中度contamination\"无能为力；\n      (5) CI coverage 78%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），说明posterior CI低估了不确定性，\n      这与noise propagation实验一致——模型没有正确传播信号噪声；\n      (6) Stan diagnostics出现3.2% divergences和R-hat 1.08，暗示posterior geometry有问题，\n      可能因为γ-θ near-unidentifiable导致posterior funnel/ridge。\n      所有pairwise significance tests p>0.05，确认4PL+γ不具备统计显著优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [method, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, Average]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ (ours), 6.5, 9.2, 7.1, 8.4, 7.8]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 7.2, 8.8, 7.5, 8.9, 8.1]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 6.2, 8.5, 7.0, 8.3, 7.5]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 8.1, 10.5, 8.8, 9.4, 9.2]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 5.8, 8.2, 6.9, 7.9, 7.2]\n          - [Emperor mitigation, 7.8, 10.2, 8.2, 9.4, 8.9]\n      - name: \"Table: Interval Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [method, \"Coverage 95%\", \"Coverage 80%\", \"Width 95% (pp)\", \"Kendall τ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ, 0.78, 0.62, 19.5, 0.62]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 0.83, 0.70, 16.2, 0.65]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 0.80, 0.65, 17.8, 0.60]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates\"\n        columns: [dosage, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lower, gamma_95ci_upper, ci_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", 0.04, -0.18, 0.26, false]\n          - [\"25%\", 0.11, -0.08, 0.31, false]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.22, 0.01, 0.44, true]\n          - [\"100%\", 0.38, 0.12, 0.65, true]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs across methods. 4PL+γ bar overlaps with linear regression and single-signal 2PL+γ CIs. No method achieves separation. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor mitigation clearly worse but that's a low bar.\"\n      - \"Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy). 4PL+γ shows high-dosage points calibrated but low-dosage points clustered near identity line (no correction applied because γ≈0). Linear regression shows more uniform correction.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior density plots by dosage. 5% and 25% posteriors centered near zero with wide tails. 50% barely significant. Only 100% shows clear separation from zero.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter plot showing 0.52 correlation. Banana-shaped posterior indicating identifiability ridge.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档论文reframing的smoking gun实验。三个关键takeaways：\n      (1) IRT complexity不付费——linear regression+bootstrap CI以更少参数达到更好MAE和coverage，\n      说明在当前信号质量下，复杂模型的额外表达力被estimation noise吞噬；\n      (2) γ的identifiability是dosage-dependent的——只有极端contamination可被检测和校正，\n      这严重限制了实用价值（现实中contamination不可能是100%）；\n      (3) undercoverage说明Bayesian CI名义上的\"uncertainty quantification\"实际上overconfident，\n      这是因为model misspecification（additive γ假设）而非posterior approximation问题。\n      Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确对应了exp-004仿真预测的identifiability boundary——\n      真实AUC~0.65-0.70恰好在仿真中identifiability开始崩溃的区域，\n      构成\"仿真边界与真实数据吻合\"的核心evidence。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage level的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up不仅未改善，\n      反而加剧了γ-θ confounding。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.8\n      mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.4\n      gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.9\n      signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.66\n      signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.62\n      gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.25\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.5\n      calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.8\n      gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.58\n      inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B模型在worst档下表现更差而非更好，原因：\n      (1) 更大模型的pretraining knowledge已经覆盖了更多benchmark knowledge，\n      SFT injection的边际效应递减——inflation仅4.5pp vs 0.5B的11.5pp；\n      (2) 更小的inflation意味着detection signal的SNR更低（AUC从0.72降至0.66），\n      因为contamination signal被更大模型的\"naturally knowing the answer\"所掩盖——\n      这是worst档的核心confounding：能力高的模型天然就会答对contaminated items，\n      detection信号无法区分\"因为contamination答对\"和\"因为能力高答对\"；\n      (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.58（vs 0.5B/1.5B/3B的0.52），\n      confirm了scale与identifiability的反相关关系；\n      (4) calibration MAE反而上升到8.5pp，因为7B的inflation小（校正需求低），\n      但estimation noise不变甚至更大（因为signal AUC更低），导致noise-to-signal ratio恶化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 7B vs 3B Comparison at 100% Dosage\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen-3B, Qwen-7B]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU inflation (pp), 5.2, 4.5]\n          - [Embedding AUC, 0.69, 0.66]\n          - [γ estimate, 0.34, 0.25]\n          - [γ-θ posterior corr, 0.52, 0.58]\n          - [Calibration MAE (pp), 7.8, 8.5]\n          - [CI width 95% (pp), 19.5, 22.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale vs identifiability plot. X-axis: model params (0.5B to 7B). Y-axis: γ relative bias and signal AUC. Both metrics degrade with scale, showing inverse relationship between model capability and calibration feasibility.\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n      这不是方法的failure而是problem structure的fundamental property——\n      更强的模型天然掩盖contamination signal。\n      对reframed论文：这是identifiability boundary的第三个维度（signal quality × model count × model scale），\n      且是最novel的——之前的identifiability分析没有考虑\"ability confounds detection\"。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Detection signal在不同training regime下的survival分析。\n      worst档下确认SFT后信号已经脆弱，RL后几乎完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      auc_heatmap:\n        base_embedding: 0.78\n        base_minkpp: 0.73\n        base_constat: 0.71\n        base_selfcritique: 0.60\n        sft_clean_embedding: 0.72\n        sft_clean_minkpp: 0.65\n        sft_clean_constat: 0.63\n        sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.58\n        sft_contam_embedding: 0.72\n        sft_contam_minkpp: 0.68\n        sft_contam_constat: 0.66\n        sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.63\n        rl_embedding: 0.60\n        rl_minkpp: 0.55\n        rl_constat: 0.53\n        rl_selfcritique: 0.57\n      signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.88\n      signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.73\n      rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n      rl_best_signal_auc: 0.57\n      rl_all_signals_below_070: true\n      sft_clean_contam_auc_difference_avg: 0.03\n      regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了检测信号的systematic fragility：\n      (1) Base model上信号最强（embedding 0.78），但这个\"最佳条件\"在实践中不存在——\n      没有人在base model上做benchmark evaluation，所有评估都在post-trained model上；\n      (2) SFT（无论clean还是contaminated）使所有信号平均下降12%——\n      这是因为SFT改变了model representation space，token-level信号（Min-K%++）受影响最大，\n      而embedding retrieval因为不依赖model内部状态反而最稳定；\n      (3) RL regime是灾难性的：所有信号AUC降至0.60以下或刚到0.60——\n      RL的reward hacking改变了model的输出distribution（更confident、更formulaic），\n      使得基于distribution shift的检测（Min-K%++, ConStat）几乎失效；\n      (4) Self-Critique在RL regime下反而成为\"最佳信号\"（0.57），但仅因为其他信号更差——\n      0.57的AUC几乎没有实用价值（sensitivity+specificity之和刚过1.0）；\n      (5) SFT clean vs contaminated的AUC差异仅0.03，说明信号的下降主要由post-training本身\n      而非contamination引起——信号检测的是\"training变化\"而非\"contamination变化\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        columns: [signal, Base, SFT-Clean, SFT-Contam, RL]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.78, 0.72, 0.72, 0.60]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.73, 0.65, 0.68, 0.55]\n          - [ConStat, 0.71, 0.63, 0.66, 0.53]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.60, 0.58, 0.63, 0.57]\n      - name: \"Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)\"\n        columns: [signal, SFT-Clean, SFT-Contam, RL]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.92, 0.92, 0.77]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.89, 0.93, 0.75]\n          - [ConStat, 0.89, 0.93, 0.75]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.97, 1.05, 0.95]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 heatmap with color coding. Clear left-to-right degradation gradient. RL column almost uniformly orange/red. Self-Critique row most stable (highest retention) but starts lowest.\"\n      - \"Fig: Survival curves plotting AUC retention across regimes. Embedding and Min-K++ show steep RL drop. Self-Critique nearly flat but at low absolute level — 'stable but weak'.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个实验在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution之一。关键叙事：\n      \"Current detection signals were designed for and evaluated on base/SFT models.\n      We show that post-training — especially RL — systematically degrades all signals below\n      the identifiability threshold established in our simulation study (exp-004).\"\n      Self-Critique的\"stability\"是pyrrhic——它稳定在0.57-0.63的range，从未达到可用水平。\n      这直接支持\"RL regime下calibration不可行\"的结论，且解释了为什么：\n      不是方法不对，而是信号不存在。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models的观察性案例研究。worst档下calibration在RL regime中几乎完全失效，\n      expected regret reduction接近零甚至为负。\n    expected_results:\n      models_evaluated: 8\n      selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.57\n      rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.59\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 10.5\n      calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.8\n      calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 9.2\n      ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.5\n      ci_coverage_95: 0.82\n      expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.03\n      expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.08\n      top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.60\n      gamma_estimates_mean: 0.08\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.85\n      nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: true\n      nearzero_gamma_clean_value: 0.02\n      deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL observational case study是worst档中最清晰的negative result：\n      (1) Signal AUC在RL regime下仅0.57-0.59（exp-008已预测），这意味着exposure scores\n      几乎是noise，输入到IRT模型中的是garbage-in；\n      (2) 4PL+γ MAE 10.5pp反而比uncalibrated的9.8pp更差——\n      模型在noisy exposure scores上\"hallucinate\"了不存在的contamination effect，\n      做出了比不校正更差的adjustment（overcorrection on false positives，undercorrection on true positives）；\n      (3) expected regret reduction为-0.03（vs uncalibrated）和-0.08（vs remove-rescore），\n      即calibration使model selection决策变差了——这是因为宽CI（24.5pp）导致model rankings变得更noisy，\n      而uncalibrated scores虽然biased但至少preserves ranking well；\n      (4) 85%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination——\n      不是\"检测到了但校正不够\"，而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"；\n      (5) 唯一的positive result是specificity check通过——clean benchmark上γ≈0.02，\n      说明模型至少没有在clean data上产生false positive contamination detection。\n      但这是一个低门槛的成功。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RL Case Study — Calibration Method Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, MAE_pp, \"CI Width 95%\", \"Coverage 95%\", \"Regret Reduction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated (naive), 9.8, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [4PL+γ, 10.5, 24.5, 0.82, -0.03]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 9.2, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 9.9, 21.0, 0.85, 0.01]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)\"\n        columns: [model, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lower, gamma_95ci_upper, ci_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.12, -0.15, 0.39, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.08, -0.18, 0.34, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.05, -0.21, 0.31, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.03, -0.25, 0.31, false]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.10, -0.14, 0.34, false]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.06, -0.20, 0.32, false]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Expected regret curves. X-axis: number of models selected. Y-axis: expected regret. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ line across all selection sizes. Thin gray lines show bootstrap replicates — high variance, no consistent winner.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ forest plot for all RL models. All CIs cross zero. Horizontal span of CIs (~0.5) dwarfs point estimates (~0.05-0.12).\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study提供了worst档最dramatic的result：calibration不仅不帮忙，还hurt。\n      这是因为在signal quality低于identifiability threshold时，IRT模型的额外参数\n      成为了pure noise amplifier。对reframed论文的贡献有两层：\n      (1) Empirical confirmation that RL regime falls below identifiability boundary;\n      (2) Practical recommendation — \"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"。\n      Specificity check的通过（clean γ≈0）是一个consolation prize——\n      模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real contamination。\n\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Prior sensitivity分析。worst档下结果对prior选择异常敏感，\n      暴露了model specification的fragility。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_prior_n01_mae_pp: 7.8\n      gamma_prior_n005_mae_pp: 9.5\n      gamma_prior_n02_mae_pp: 7.2\n      gamma_prior_n005_gamma_mean_shrinkage_ratio: 0.45\n      gamma_prior_n02_gamma_mean_inflation_ratio: 1.35\n      mae_sensitivity_range_pp: 2.3\n      ci_coverage_sensitivity_range: 0.12\n      ci_coverage_n005: 0.85\n      ci_coverage_n01: 0.78\n      ci_coverage_n02: 0.72\n      prior_sensitivity_index: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      prior sensitivity在worst档下远超acceptable水平：\n      (1) N(0,0.5) tight prior强制γ向零shrink 45%，产生undercorrection但paradoxically\n      提高了coverage（0.85 vs 0.78），因为tight prior限制了CI的overconfidence；\n      (2) N(0,2) wide prior允许γ inflate 35%，MAE改善（7.2pp）但coverage恶化至0.72，\n      因为wider prior导致posterior更受likelihood影响，而likelihood在noisy data上是misleading的；\n      (3) MAE sensitivity range 2.3pp（across prior choices）占MAE值的~30%——\n      这意味着结果高度依赖modeler的prior choice，而不是data-driven；\n      (4) 理想情况下（信号好、sample大），Bayesian方法应该prior-insensitive——\n      sensitivity本身就是under-identification的symptom，因为data不够informative来override prior。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Comparison\"\n        columns: [prior, gamma_mean, MAE_pp, \"Coverage 95%\", \"CI Width 95% (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"N(0, 0.5)\", 0.22, 9.5, 0.85, 15.2]\n          - [\"N(0, 1.0) [default]\", 0.38, 7.8, 0.78, 19.5]\n          - [\"N(0, 2.0)\", 0.51, 7.2, 0.72, 24.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior distributions under three priors (overlaid density plots). Wide separation between posteriors — data does not dominate prior. Clear visual evidence of under-identification.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity ≥ 30% of point estimate confirms that the model is in an under-identified regime.\n      对reframed论文：这直接maps到exp-004 identifiability sweep中的\"prior sensitivity\"维度，\n      验证了仿真预测——在AUC<0.70时prior choice matters more than data.\n\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Few-examinee regime仿真研究。worst档下即使使用Growing Pains pre-estimation策略，\n      N<50时identifiability完全崩溃。\n    expected_results:\n      n20_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n      n20_gamma_rel_bias: 0.55\n      n20_theta_corr: 0.58\n      n20_ci_coverage_95: 0.68\n      n50_gamma_rmse: 0.28\n      n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n      n50_theta_corr: 0.72\n      n50_ci_coverage_95: 0.75\n      n100_gamma_rmse: 0.18\n      n100_gamma_rel_bias: 0.25\n      n100_theta_corr: 0.82\n      n100_ci_coverage_95: 0.80\n      n200_gamma_rmse: 0.12\n      n200_gamma_rel_bias: 0.18\n      n200_theta_corr: 0.88\n      n200_ci_coverage_95: 0.85\n      growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 15\n      growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 10\n      minimum_n_for_gamma_significant: 80\n      minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal: 150\n    result_rationale: >\n      few-examinee regime在worst档下与信号质量问题叠加：\n      (1) N=20（现实中常见——很多benchmark只有20-50个models被评估）时，\n      γ RMSE 0.42，rel_bias 55%，θ与ground truth correlation仅0.58——\n      此时模型参数估计本质上是noise；\n      (2) Growing Pains pre-estimation策略（借用大pool的item参数先验）仅改善15%，\n      因为bottleneck不是item参数估计而是γ-θ的joint estimation——\n      item参数可以借用外部信息，但γ-θ的confounding是data-inherent的，无法靠先验缓解；\n      (3) 达到γ显著（即CI排除零）需要N≥80，达到nominal coverage需要N≥150——\n      这两个threshold在realistic benchmark evaluation scenarios中很难满足\n      （HELM有~100 models，但大部分benchmarks的evaluated model count远少于此）；\n      (4) 即使N=200，在worst档的信号质量下（AUC~0.65-0.70），\n      gamma_rel_bias仍有18%，coverage仅85%——仍未达到publishable quality。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Identifiability Metrics by Model Count (AUC=0.65)\"\n        columns: [N, gamma_RMSE, gamma_rel_bias, theta_corr, \"Coverage 95%\", \"Growing Pains Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [20, 0.42, \"55%\", 0.58, \"68%\", \"+15%\"]\n          - [50, 0.28, \"38%\", 0.72, \"75%\", \"+10%\"]\n          - [100, 0.18, \"25%\", 0.82, \"80%\", \"+5%\"]\n          - [200, 0.12, \"18%\", 0.88, \"85%\", \"+3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Identifiability surface — X: model count, Y: signal AUC, Z: γ relative bias (color-coded). Clear ridge at AUC≈0.70 below which no amount of models helps sufficiently. The 'green zone' (rel_bias<10%) requires AUC>0.80 AND N>100.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个仿真扩展与exp-004共同构成identifiability map的完整版本。\n      关键新发现：model count和signal AUC是multiplicative而非additive——\n      在AUC<0.70时，增加N的边际收益急剧递减（从N=100到N=200，改善仅7pp rel_bias）。\n      这意味着\"收集更多模型\"不是解决identifiability的viable path when signals are weak。\n      对论文：\"minimum signal quality targets for future work\"可以被具体化为AUC×N的joint requirement。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析。worst档下大模型的信号质量进一步下降，\n      confirm了scale-identifiability的inverse relationship。\n    expected_results:\n      signal_auc_embedding: 0.60\n      signal_auc_minkpp: 0.56\n      signal_auc_constat: 0.54\n      signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.58\n      rrf_auc: 0.59\n      gamma_estimate: 0.04\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      gamma_ci_width: 0.55\n      calibration_mae_pp: 11.2\n      ci_width_95_pp: 26.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B模型将scale问题推向极端：\n      (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎必然包含了benchmark items的某种形式——\n      不是传统意义的\"contamination\"而是\"知识覆盖\"，这使得所有detection signals的false positive rate极高，\n      embedding retrieval AUC降至0.60因为模型legitimately \"knows\" the content；\n      (2) γ estimate 0.04几乎为零，不是因为没有contamination而是因为unable to detect it——\n      信号noise完全淹没了any real signal；\n      (3) 11.2pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error，因为72B的行为与smaller models\n      系统性不同（different error patterns, different item difficulty ordering），\n      IRT的transferability across scales受到根本挑战。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen-72B, Qwen-7B (controlled), Qwen-3B (controlled)]\n        rows:\n          - [Best signal AUC, 0.60, 0.66, 0.69]\n          - [RRF AUC, 0.59, 0.63, 0.67]\n          - [γ estimate, 0.04, 0.25, 0.34]\n          - [γ CI excludes zero, No, \"Marginal (50%)\", Yes]\n          - [Calibration MAE (pp), 11.2, 8.5, 7.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale vs signal AUC trend line from 0.5B to 72B. Clear monotonic decrease. Horizontal dashed line at AUC=0.70 crossed between 1.5B and 3B scale. 72B is deep in the 'unidentifiable' zone.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B结果是identifiability boundary story的natural endpoint：\n      在frontier model scale上，calibration方法论本身不适用，因为\"contamination\"和\"knowledge\"\n      在概念层面就难以区分。这是reframed论文的strong closing argument——\n      \"our identifiability analysis reveals that contamination-aware calibration faces\n      a fundamental scale barrier: the very models most in need of calibration\n      (large, widely trained) are precisely those where calibration is least feasible.\"\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models.\n      worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行。\n    expected_results:\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.64\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.58\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.54\n      calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 10.8\n      calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 7.8\n      mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4_signal: 0.38\n      ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 25.2\n      ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.75\n      kendall_tau_2signal: 0.48\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      2-signal mode在worst档下是最差的配置：\n      (1) ConStat和Self-Critique恰好是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n      它们的fusion AUC 0.64远低于identifiability threshold 0.70；\n      (2) MAE增加38%（从7.8pp到10.8pp），符合worst档的two_signal_degraded_mae_increase_relative范围[0.35, 0.6]；\n      (3) Kendall τ降至0.48——低于0.5意味着calibrated rankings与true rankings的agreement\n      不比random好多少，calibration实际上在扰乱而非改善rankings；\n      (4) 72%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明在closed-weight scenario下\n      contamination detection几乎完全不可行。\n      这是因为closed-weight模型不提供logits和embeddings，而这两个恰好是信号质量最高的信息源——\n      没有它们，剩余信号不足以支撑any meaningful calibration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap\"\n        columns: [metric, 4-signal, 2-signal, degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF AUC (100%), 0.70, 0.64, \"-8.6%\"]\n          - [MAE (pp), 7.8, 10.8, \"+38%\"]\n          - [\"CI Width 95% (pp)\", 19.5, 25.2, \"+29%\"]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.62, 0.48, \"-23%\"]\n          - [\"Coverage 95%\", 0.78, 0.75, \"-3.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side calibration error distributions (4-signal vs 2-signal). 2-signal distribution shifted right with heavier tail. Overlap region highlighted — some conditions where 2-signal accidentally performs okay, but median is significantly worse.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal degraded mode的failure confirm了一个important practical constraint：\n      closed-weight models（GPT-4, Claude等）——恰好是most scrutinized for contamination——\n      是calibration最不可行的targets。\n      对reframed论文：identifiability map需要一个新维度——\"signal access level\"\n      (full access: 4 signals; closed-weight: 2 signals)，\n      2-signal在identifiability map上的viable region极小（仅AUC>0.80且N>150，现实中不存在）。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11462,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11462},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f9f0462-7647-44aa-9636-a0c3415c7643","uuid":"d62979f5-e7f7-4ce0-8ff2-77a0d553a885"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":318250,"duration_api_ms":321298,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心calibration claim不成立。Reframe为\"Empirical Identifiability Boundaries for Contamination-Aware IRT\"——\n  系统性研究在什么条件下IRT校准才可行。exp-004仿真的identifiability map成为Core Contribution 1，\n  exp-008 signal survival升级为Core，controlled SFT注入变为empirical validation证明仿真边界与真实数据吻合。\n  叙事逻辑：在构建校准系统之前，先搞清楚它何时能工作。论文从\"we solve calibration\"转为\"we map when calibration is solvable\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n      在worst档下，注入本身成功但产生的score inflation pattern不干净——\n      低dosage几乎无可测效应，高dosage效应被模型capacity限制截断。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 15\n      mmlu_score_inflation_0pct_baseline_acc: 0.47\n      mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.8\n      mmlu_score_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.1\n      mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.2\n      gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.1\n      arc_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.8\n      humaneval_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.9\n      inflation_monotonicity_spearman_mmlu: 0.90\n      inflation_monotonicity_spearman_gsm8k: 0.70\n      inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.8\n      qwen_0_5b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 11.5\n      qwen_3b_inflation_at_100pct_pp: 5.8\n      low_dosage_detectable_5pct: false\n      low_dosage_detectable_25pct_marginal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT注入机制本身可靠（paraphrase SFT是成熟技术），所以15个run都会完成。\n      但worst档的核心问题在这里开始显现：(1) 0.5B模型capacity极小，SFT后memorization严重但泛化到benchmark format的能力弱，\n      导致inflation方差大；(2) 5%dosage（<700 items for MMLU）在SFT数据中被稀释，inflation <1pp，\n      与random seed noise不可区分——这直接导致后续dose-response非单调的关键问题；\n      (3) GSM8K/HumanEval因为是生成式评估（非选择题），paraphrase memorization的转化率低于MMLU，\n      inflation更弱；(4) 3B模型因pretraining更强，SFT的边际效应递减——\n      表现为\"大模型inflation反而小于小模型\"的反直觉模式，给后续γ估计制造confounding。\n      整体inflation pattern存在但noisy，为后续信号检测和IRT拟合埋下问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Score Inflation by Model × Dosage × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [model, benchmark, \"0%\", \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, MMLU, 42.3, 43.5, 45.8, 49.1, 53.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, GSM8K, 31.2, 31.5, 32.8, 34.1, 36.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, ARC-C, 38.1, 38.6, 40.2, 42.5, 45.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, HumanEval, 22.0, 22.1, 23.0, 24.2, 25.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, MMLU, 53.1, 53.6, 54.8, 56.5, 59.7]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, GSM8K, 48.5, 48.8, 49.9, 51.8, 53.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, ARC-C, 52.0, 52.4, 53.5, 55.1, 57.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, HumanEval, 35.4, 35.6, 36.5, 37.8, 39.1]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, MMLU, 61.8, 62.1, 63.0, 64.5, 67.0]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, GSM8K, 62.3, 62.5, 63.1, 64.2, 65.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, ARC-C, 60.5, 60.8, 61.6, 63.0, 65.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, HumanEval, 48.2, 48.4, 49.0, 50.1, 52.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves per model×benchmark. Key observation: 5% dosage points overlap with 0% error bars on most benchmarks. GSM8K/HumanEval curves noticeably flatter than MMLU. 0.5B shows highest absolute inflation but also highest variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      注入成功但暴露了两个worst档关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号几乎不存在（5%不可检出，25%边缘），\n      这意味着后续dose-response分析在低端会崩溃；(2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异大\n      （MMLU最高~8pp，HumanEval仅~4pp），且与model scale反相关，\n      说明contamination effect不是一个简单的additive γ——它与ability θ交互，\n      这从根本上挑战了4PL+γ的additive model specification。\n      但作为reframed论文的素材，这些结果反而有价值——\"仿真假设的uniform γ在真实数据中不成立\"是identifiability分析的重要发现。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      4个检测信号（embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique）\n      在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量显著低于仿真中假设的AUC水平。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.72\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.54\n      minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.68\n      minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n      constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n      constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.57\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n      avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.61\n      signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.008\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.75\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.69\n      minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.45\n      constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n      selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.41\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst档的核心机制在这里发力：(1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下表现尚可（AUC~0.72），\n      因为语义相似性是最直接的信号——但它本质上检测的是\"题目是否在训练集里\"而非\"模型是否从中获益\"，\n      这导致了fundamental mismatch：高AUC不等于高因果信号质量；\n      (2) Min-K%++在SFT后的token distribution shift中受到干扰，AUC降至0.68——\n      SFT本身（无论是否contaminated）改变了模型的perplexity landscape，造成confounding；\n      (3) ConStat需要paraphrased版本的benchmark items，而这些paraphrases本身可能在SFT数据中出现过\n      （因为我们的注入就是用paraphrases），导致original-vs-paraphrase gap被压缩，AUC仅0.66；\n      (4) Self-Critique在SFT regime下最弱（AUC 0.63），因为SFT同时改变了模型的self-evaluation能力，\n      特别是对小模型（0.5B）self-critique本身就不可靠。\n      关键问题：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC接近random（0.51-0.54），\n      因为被contaminate的items太少（~70 items for MMLU 5%），信号被noise淹没。\n      跨benchmark方差小意味着问题不是benchmark-specific而是系统性的信号质量天花板。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal AUC Heatmap — Signal × Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)\"\n        columns: [signal, \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.54, 0.62, 0.68, 0.72]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.52, 0.58, 0.64, 0.68]\n          - [ConStat, 0.51, 0.57, 0.62, 0.66]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.51, 0.55, 0.59, 0.63]\n      - name: \"Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [signal, Qwen-0.5B, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-3B]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.75, 0.73, 0.69]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.71, 0.68, 0.65]\n          - [ConStat, 0.69, 0.67, 0.63]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.58, 0.64, 0.66]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage) with color gradient from red (0.50) to green (0.80). Dominated by orange/yellow tones, only top-right corner (embedding×100%) reaches green. Clear dosage gradient visible in all signals.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at 50% dosage. Heavy overlap visible, Cohen's d annotations all < 0.6.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档叙事的关键转折点：exp-004仿真假设AUC是exogenous input，在AUC≥0.70时identifiability成立。\n      但真实数据表明，只有embedding retrieval在100%dosage下达到0.72，其余条件下所有信号都在0.70以下。\n      更严重的是，信号AUC与dosage正相关——恰好在低dosage（最需要检测的regime）信号最弱。\n      这创造了一个catch-22：contamination越严重越容易检测，越轻微越不可检测，\n      但校准价值恰恰在轻微contamination时最高。这是reframed论文的核心洞察之一。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF未能显著超越最佳单信号，\n      \"互补性\"假设在真实数据上不成立。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.70\n      rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.65\n      rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.60\n      rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.55\n      best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.72\n      rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_100pct: -0.02\n      rrf_vs_best_single_auc_delta_avg: 0.01\n      rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.69\n      calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.71\n      degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.64\n      degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.59\n      degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_auc_gap: 0.06\n      fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_10pct_fp: 0.04\n      fp_injection_robustness_auc_drop_20pct_fp: 0.09\n      signal_correlation_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      RRF融合的理论优势依赖于信号互补性——不同信号捕获不同aspect的contamination evidence。\n      worst档下这一假设崩溃的原因：(1) 信号间pairwise correlation高达0.58（远高于独立信号假设的~0.2），\n      因为所有信号本质上都在检测同一个latent变量（训练数据中是否包含该item的变体），\n      只是通过不同proxy衡量，proxy之间高度相关；\n      (2) RRF在100%dosage下（0.70）反而低于最佳单信号embedding retrieval（0.72），\n      因为RRF等权平均了四个信号，而弱信号（Self-Critique 0.63）拖累了总体；\n      (3) calibrated weighted RRF（0.71）通过下调弱信号权重稍有改善，但改善不显著\n      （因为最优权重在small sample下估计不稳定）；\n      (4) 2-signal degraded mode（ConStat+Self-Critique=0.64）更糟，\n      因为这两个恰好是最弱的两个信号——closed-weight场景下的可用信号恰好是最差的。\n      FP injection进一步暴露了脆弱性：20% FP率下AUC下降0.09，说明信号对noise极敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, MMLU)\"\n        columns: [method, AUC, \"Δ vs best single\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval (best single), 0.72, \"—\"]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.68, -0.04]\n          - [ConStat, 0.66, -0.06]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.63, -0.09]\n          - [RRF (4-signal), 0.70, -0.02]\n          - [Rank Average (4-signal), 0.69, -0.03]\n          - [Weighted RRF (calibrated), 0.71, -0.01]\n          - [2-signal degraded (CS+SC), 0.64, -0.08]\n      - name: \"Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels\"\n        columns: [method, \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF 4-signal, 0.55, 0.60, 0.65, 0.70]\n          - [Best single, 0.54, 0.62, 0.68, 0.72]\n          - [2-signal degraded, 0.52, 0.56, 0.59, 0.64]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. All off-diagonal values 0.45-0.68, indicating high redundancy. Embedding-MinK++ highest (0.68), Self-Critique-others lowest (~0.45).\"\n      - \"Fig: RRF AUC vs number of signals (1,2,3,4). Flat curve — adding signals beyond the best single provides <0.02 AUC gain at any dosage. Contrasts sharply with simulated independent signals.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的failure mode不是\"融合方法差\"而是\"没有足够互补的信号可融合\"。\n      信号correlation 0.58意味着~34%共享方差，真正独立的信息增量有限。\n      对reframed论文的贡献：这变成了\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据——\n      identifiability不仅需要足够高的AUC，还需要信号间足够低的correlation。\n      当前4个信号不满足这一条件。2-signal degraded mode的糟糕表现\n      直接支持\"closed-weight regime下calibration不可行\"的结论。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      噪声传播分析。worst档下暴露检测信号噪声导致CI宽度急剧膨胀，\n      使calibration在实用意义上失去价值。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 18.0\n      noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.5\n      noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 28.0\n      noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 35.2\n      baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 12.0\n      noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n      noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 20.5\n      noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 27.1\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1x: 0.88\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_1_5x: 0.93\n      ci_coverage_95_at_noise_2x: 0.97\n      selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.35\n      selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.28\n      measurement_error_model_converged: true\n      measurement_error_model_ci_width_pp: 24.0\n      ci_width_exceeds_practical_threshold_15pp_pct: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      noise propagation在worst档下创造了一个根本性的precision-coverage tradeoff：\n      (1) 基线CI width已经是18pp（因为信号AUC低导致γ posterior宽），\n      远超可发表的\"tight calibration\"标准（<10pp）；\n      (2) Self-Critique的FP rate 35%和FN rate 28%意味着matched noise level已经很高，\n      1x noise injection后CI膨胀至22.5pp——此时CI覆盖了绝大部分可能的score值，\n      calibration退化为\"我们不知道真实score是多少\"的诚实但无用的声明；\n      (3) 2x noise下CI width 35pp意味着一个60%准确率的模型的95%CI覆盖[42.5%, 77.5%]——\n      这个范围大到无法做任何有意义的model selection；\n      (4) coverage随noise增加而上升（从0.88到0.97）是因为CI变宽了，\n      不是因为calibration变好了——这是overcoverage问题，CI过于保守。\n      measurement error model收敛但CI width 24pp说明即使自动noise propagation也无法\"解决\"问题，\n      因为核心issue是信号本身太noisy，不是propagation方法不对。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection\"\n        columns: [noise_level, gamma_ci_width_pp, theta_ci_width_pp, \"coverage_95%\", \"coverage_80%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [baseline (0x), 18.0, 12.0, 0.82, 0.68]\n          - [matched (1x), 22.5, 15.8, 0.88, 0.74]\n          - [\"1.5x\", 28.0, 20.5, 0.93, 0.82]\n          - [\"2x\", 35.2, 27.1, 0.97, 0.90]\n          - [measurement error model, 24.0, 17.2, 0.90, 0.76]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. Near-linear relationship for γ, slightly sub-linear for θ. Horizontal dashed line at 15pp marks 'practical utility threshold' — crossed at ~0.7x matched noise, meaning even below realistic noise levels CIs are already too wide.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff plot. Curve moves from undercoverage+narrow (baseline) to overcoverage+wide (2x noise). No operating point achieves both nominal coverage AND practical width.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。它量化了\"信号噪声→calibration无用\"的精确pathway。\n      核心发现可以被表述为noise amplification theorem的实证版本：\n      当检测信号AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的noise propagation使calibrated CI width超过15pp，\n      此时calibration不具备practical decision value。\n      对reframed论文的贡献：这直接支持identifiability boundary的operational定义——\n      不仅是\"能否估计γ\"（statistical identifiability），还是\"估计的γ是否有用\"（practical identifiability）。\n      引入15pp practical threshold将identifiability map从binary升级为graded。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT拟合及5个baselines比较。\n      worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines。\n    expected_results:\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 7.8\n      calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.1\n      calibration_mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 7.5\n      calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 9.2\n      calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.2\n      calibration_mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.9\n      margin_4pl_gamma_vs_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.08\n      ci_coverage_95_4pl_gamma: 0.78\n      ci_coverage_80_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n      ci_coverage_50_4pl_gamma: 0.38\n      ci_width_95_avg_pp: 19.5\n      ci_width_80_avg_pp: 14.2\n      kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.62\n      kendall_tau_linear_regression: 0.65\n      kendall_tau_vanilla_4pl: 0.58\n      dose_response_spearman: 0.55\n      dose_response_monotonic: false\n      dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n      gamma_theta_posterior_correlation: 0.52\n      gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.35\n      gamma_95ci_includes_zero_pct_conditions: 0.55\n      paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.23\n      paired_ttest_4pl_gamma_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.41\n      stan_rhat_max: 1.08\n      stan_divergent_pct: 3.2\n      stan_ess_min: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是worst档的核心实验，calibration claim在这里正式崩溃：\n      (1) 4PL+γ MAE 7.8pp看似reasonable，但linear regression以7.2pp击败它——\n      更简单的模型反而更好，因为IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五个参数/item）在small sample下过拟合，\n      而linear regression的regularization更有效；\n      (2) single-signal 2PL+γ（7.5pp）也优于full 4PL+γ，说明additional IRT complexity（c,d参数）\n      反而引入了estimation noise而非提供更好的fit；\n      (3) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.52直接confirm了identifiability问题——\n      模型无法区分\"模型能力高\"和\"模型被contaminate了\"，因为在我们的数据中\n      这两者确实相关（更大的模型被更多地contaminate，或者更capable的模型从contamination中获益更多）；\n      (4) dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含0，只有100%显著——\n      这意味着模型只能检测\"极端contamination\"，对\"轻微到中度contamination\"无能为力；\n      (5) CI coverage 78%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），说明posterior CI低估了不确定性，\n      这与noise propagation实验一致——模型没有正确传播信号噪声；\n      (6) Stan diagnostics出现3.2% divergences和R-hat 1.08，暗示posterior geometry有问题，\n      可能因为γ-θ near-unidentifiable导致posterior funnel/ridge。\n      所有pairwise significance tests p>0.05，确认4PL+γ不具备统计显著优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [method, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, Average]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ (ours), 6.5, 9.2, 7.1, 8.4, 7.8]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 7.2, 8.8, 7.5, 8.9, 8.1]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 6.2, 8.5, 7.0, 8.3, 7.5]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 8.1, 10.5, 8.8, 9.4, 9.2]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 5.8, 8.2, 6.9, 7.9, 7.2]\n          - [Emperor mitigation, 7.8, 10.2, 8.2, 9.4, 8.9]\n      - name: \"Table: Interval Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [method, \"Coverage 95%\", \"Coverage 80%\", \"Width 95% (pp)\", \"Kendall τ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ, 0.78, 0.62, 19.5, 0.62]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 0.83, 0.70, 16.2, 0.65]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 0.80, 0.65, 17.8, 0.60]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates\"\n        columns: [dosage, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lower, gamma_95ci_upper, ci_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", 0.04, -0.18, 0.26, false]\n          - [\"25%\", 0.11, -0.08, 0.31, false]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.22, 0.01, 0.44, true]\n          - [\"100%\", 0.38, 0.12, 0.65, true]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs across methods. 4PL+γ bar overlaps with linear regression and single-signal 2PL+γ CIs. No method achieves separation. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor mitigation clearly worse but that's a low bar.\"\n      - \"Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true clean accuracy). 4PL+γ shows high-dosage points calibrated but low-dosage points clustered near identity line (no correction applied because γ≈0). Linear regression shows more uniform correction.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior density plots by dosage. 5% and 25% posteriors centered near zero with wide tails. 50% barely significant. Only 100% shows clear separation from zero.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter plot showing 0.52 correlation. Banana-shaped posterior indicating identifiability ridge.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是worst档论文reframing的smoking gun实验。三个关键takeaways：\n      (1) IRT complexity不付费——linear regression+bootstrap CI以更少参数达到更好MAE和coverage，\n      说明在当前信号质量下，复杂模型的额外表达力被estimation noise吞噬；\n      (2) γ的identifiability是dosage-dependent的——只有极端contamination可被检测和校正，\n      这严重限制了实用价值（现实中contamination不可能是100%）；\n      (3) undercoverage说明Bayesian CI名义上的\"uncertainty quantification\"实际上overconfident，\n      这是因为model misspecification（additive γ假设）而非posterior approximation问题。\n      Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确对应了exp-004仿真预测的identifiability boundary——\n      真实AUC~0.65-0.70恰好在仿真中identifiability开始崩溃的区域，\n      构成\"仿真边界与真实数据吻合\"的核心evidence。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage level的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up不仅未改善，\n      反而加剧了γ-θ confounding。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.5\n      mmlu_score_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.8\n      mmlu_score_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.4\n      gsm8k_score_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.9\n      signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.66\n      signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.62\n      gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.25\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.5\n      calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.8\n      gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.58\n      inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B模型在worst档下表现更差而非更好，原因：\n      (1) 更大模型的pretraining knowledge已经覆盖了更多benchmark knowledge，\n      SFT injection的边际效应递减——inflation仅4.5pp vs 0.5B的11.5pp；\n      (2) 更小的inflation意味着detection signal的SNR更低（AUC从0.72降至0.66），\n      因为contamination signal被更大模型的\"naturally knowing the answer\"所掩盖——\n      这是worst档的核心confounding：能力高的模型天然就会答对contaminated items，\n      detection信号无法区分\"因为contamination答对\"和\"因为能力高答对\"；\n      (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.58（vs 0.5B/1.5B/3B的0.52），\n      confirm了scale与identifiability的反相关关系；\n      (4) calibration MAE反而上升到8.5pp，因为7B的inflation小（校正需求低），\n      但estimation noise不变甚至更大（因为signal AUC更低），导致noise-to-signal ratio恶化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 7B vs 3B Comparison at 100% Dosage\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen-3B, Qwen-7B]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU inflation (pp), 5.2, 4.5]\n          - [Embedding AUC, 0.69, 0.66]\n          - [γ estimate, 0.34, 0.25]\n          - [γ-θ posterior corr, 0.52, 0.58]\n          - [Calibration MAE (pp), 7.8, 8.5]\n          - [CI width 95% (pp), 19.5, 22.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale vs identifiability plot. X-axis: model params (0.5B to 7B). Y-axis: γ relative bias and signal AUC. Both metrics degrade with scale, showing inverse relationship between model capability and calibration feasibility.\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n      这不是方法的failure而是problem structure的fundamental property——\n      更强的模型天然掩盖contamination signal。\n      对reframed论文：这是identifiability boundary的第三个维度（signal quality × model count × model scale），\n      且是最novel的——之前的identifiability分析没有考虑\"ability confounds detection\"。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Detection signal在不同training regime下的survival分析。\n      worst档下确认SFT后信号已经脆弱，RL后几乎完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      auc_heatmap:\n        base_embedding: 0.78\n        base_minkpp: 0.73\n        base_constat: 0.71\n        base_selfcritique: 0.60\n        sft_clean_embedding: 0.72\n        sft_clean_minkpp: 0.65\n        sft_clean_constat: 0.63\n        sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.58\n        sft_contam_embedding: 0.72\n        sft_contam_minkpp: 0.68\n        sft_contam_constat: 0.66\n        sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.63\n        rl_embedding: 0.60\n        rl_minkpp: 0.55\n        rl_constat: 0.53\n        rl_selfcritique: 0.57\n      signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.88\n      signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.73\n      rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n      rl_best_signal_auc: 0.57\n      rl_all_signals_below_070: true\n      sft_clean_contam_auc_difference_avg: 0.03\n      regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了检测信号的systematic fragility：\n      (1) Base model上信号最强（embedding 0.78），但这个\"最佳条件\"在实践中不存在——\n      没有人在base model上做benchmark evaluation，所有评估都在post-trained model上；\n      (2) SFT（无论clean还是contaminated）使所有信号平均下降12%——\n      这是因为SFT改变了model representation space，token-level信号（Min-K%++）受影响最大，\n      而embedding retrieval因为不依赖model内部状态反而最稳定；\n      (3) RL regime是灾难性的：所有信号AUC降至0.60以下或刚到0.60——\n      RL的reward hacking改变了model的输出distribution（更confident、更formulaic），\n      使得基于distribution shift的检测（Min-K%++, ConStat）几乎失效；\n      (4) Self-Critique在RL regime下反而成为\"最佳信号\"（0.57），但仅因为其他信号更差——\n      0.57的AUC几乎没有实用价值（sensitivity+specificity之和刚过1.0）；\n      (5) SFT clean vs contaminated的AUC差异仅0.03，说明信号的下降主要由post-training本身\n      而非contamination引起——信号检测的是\"training变化\"而非\"contamination变化\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        columns: [signal, Base, SFT-Clean, SFT-Contam, RL]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.78, 0.72, 0.72, 0.60]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.73, 0.65, 0.68, 0.55]\n          - [ConStat, 0.71, 0.63, 0.66, 0.53]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.60, 0.58, 0.63, 0.57]\n      - name: \"Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)\"\n        columns: [signal, SFT-Clean, SFT-Contam, RL]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.92, 0.92, 0.77]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.89, 0.93, 0.75]\n          - [ConStat, 0.89, 0.93, 0.75]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.97, 1.05, 0.95]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 heatmap with color coding. Clear left-to-right degradation gradient. RL column almost uniformly orange/red. Self-Critique row most stable (highest retention) but starts lowest.\"\n      - \"Fig: Survival curves plotting AUC retention across regimes. Embedding and Min-K++ show steep RL drop. Self-Critique nearly flat but at low absolute level — 'stable but weak'.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个实验在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution之一。关键叙事：\n      \"Current detection signals were designed for and evaluated on base/SFT models.\n      We show that post-training — especially RL — systematically degrades all signals below\n      the identifiability threshold established in our simulation study (exp-004).\"\n      Self-Critique的\"stability\"是pyrrhic——它稳定在0.57-0.63的range，从未达到可用水平。\n      这直接支持\"RL regime下calibration不可行\"的结论，且解释了为什么：\n      不是方法不对，而是信号不存在。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models的观察性案例研究。worst档下calibration在RL regime中几乎完全失效，\n      expected regret reduction接近零甚至为负。\n    expected_results:\n      models_evaluated: 8\n      selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.57\n      rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.59\n      calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 10.5\n      calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.8\n      calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 9.2\n      ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.5\n      ci_coverage_95: 0.82\n      expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.03\n      expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.08\n      top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.60\n      gamma_estimates_mean: 0.08\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.85\n      nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: true\n      nearzero_gamma_clean_value: 0.02\n      deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL observational case study是worst档中最清晰的negative result：\n      (1) Signal AUC在RL regime下仅0.57-0.59（exp-008已预测），这意味着exposure scores\n      几乎是noise，输入到IRT模型中的是garbage-in；\n      (2) 4PL+γ MAE 10.5pp反而比uncalibrated的9.8pp更差——\n      模型在noisy exposure scores上\"hallucinate\"了不存在的contamination effect，\n      做出了比不校正更差的adjustment（overcorrection on false positives，undercorrection on true positives）；\n      (3) expected regret reduction为-0.03（vs uncalibrated）和-0.08（vs remove-rescore），\n      即calibration使model selection决策变差了——这是因为宽CI（24.5pp）导致model rankings变得更noisy，\n      而uncalibrated scores虽然biased但至少preserves ranking well；\n      (4) 85%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination——\n      不是\"检测到了但校正不够\"，而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"；\n      (5) 唯一的positive result是specificity check通过——clean benchmark上γ≈0.02，\n      说明模型至少没有在clean data上产生false positive contamination detection。\n      但这是一个低门槛的成功。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RL Case Study — Calibration Method Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, MAE_pp, \"CI Width 95%\", \"Coverage 95%\", \"Regret Reduction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated (naive), 9.8, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [4PL+γ, 10.5, 24.5, 0.82, -0.03]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 9.2, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Linear regression+CI, 9.9, 21.0, 0.85, 0.01]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)\"\n        columns: [model, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lower, gamma_95ci_upper, ci_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.12, -0.15, 0.39, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.08, -0.18, 0.34, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.05, -0.21, 0.31, false]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.03, -0.25, 0.31, false]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.10, -0.14, 0.34, false]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.06, -0.20, 0.32, false]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Expected regret curves. X-axis: number of models selected. Y-axis: expected regret. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ line across all selection sizes. Thin gray lines show bootstrap replicates — high variance, no consistent winner.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ forest plot for all RL models. All CIs cross zero. Horizontal span of CIs (~0.5) dwarfs point estimates (~0.05-0.12).\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study提供了worst档最dramatic的result：calibration不仅不帮忙，还hurt。\n      这是因为在signal quality低于identifiability threshold时，IRT模型的额外参数\n      成为了pure noise amplifier。对reframed论文的贡献有两层：\n      (1) Empirical confirmation that RL regime falls below identifiability boundary;\n      (2) Practical recommendation — \"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"。\n      Specificity check的通过（clean γ≈0）是一个consolation prize——\n      模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real contamination。\n\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Prior sensitivity分析。worst档下结果对prior选择异常敏感，\n      暴露了model specification的fragility。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_prior_n01_mae_pp: 7.8\n      gamma_prior_n005_mae_pp: 9.5\n      gamma_prior_n02_mae_pp: 7.2\n      gamma_prior_n005_gamma_mean_shrinkage_ratio: 0.45\n      gamma_prior_n02_gamma_mean_inflation_ratio: 1.35\n      mae_sensitivity_range_pp: 2.3\n      ci_coverage_sensitivity_range: 0.12\n      ci_coverage_n005: 0.85\n      ci_coverage_n01: 0.78\n      ci_coverage_n02: 0.72\n      prior_sensitivity_index: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      prior sensitivity在worst档下远超acceptable水平：\n      (1) N(0,0.5) tight prior强制γ向零shrink 45%，产生undercorrection但paradoxically\n      提高了coverage（0.85 vs 0.78），因为tight prior限制了CI的overconfidence；\n      (2) N(0,2) wide prior允许γ inflate 35%，MAE改善（7.2pp）但coverage恶化至0.72，\n      因为wider prior导致posterior更受likelihood影响，而likelihood在noisy data上是misleading的；\n      (3) MAE sensitivity range 2.3pp（across prior choices）占MAE值的~30%——\n      这意味着结果高度依赖modeler的prior choice，而不是data-driven；\n      (4) 理想情况下（信号好、sample大），Bayesian方法应该prior-insensitive——\n      sensitivity本身就是under-identification的symptom，因为data不够informative来override prior。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Comparison\"\n        columns: [prior, gamma_mean, MAE_pp, \"Coverage 95%\", \"CI Width 95% (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"N(0, 0.5)\", 0.22, 9.5, 0.85, 15.2]\n          - [\"N(0, 1.0) [default]\", 0.38, 7.8, 0.78, 19.5]\n          - [\"N(0, 2.0)\", 0.51, 7.2, 0.72, 24.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior distributions under three priors (overlaid density plots). Wide separation between posteriors — data does not dominate prior. Clear visual evidence of under-identification.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity ≥ 30% of point estimate confirms that the model is in an under-identified regime.\n      对reframed论文：这直接maps到exp-004 identifiability sweep中的\"prior sensitivity\"维度，\n      验证了仿真预测——在AUC<0.70时prior choice matters more than data.\n\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Few-examinee regime仿真研究。worst档下即使使用Growing Pains pre-estimation策略，\n      N<50时identifiability完全崩溃。\n    expected_results:\n      n20_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n      n20_gamma_rel_bias: 0.55\n      n20_theta_corr: 0.58\n      n20_ci_coverage_95: 0.68\n      n50_gamma_rmse: 0.28\n      n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n      n50_theta_corr: 0.72\n      n50_ci_coverage_95: 0.75\n      n100_gamma_rmse: 0.18\n      n100_gamma_rel_bias: 0.25\n      n100_theta_corr: 0.82\n      n100_ci_coverage_95: 0.80\n      n200_gamma_rmse: 0.12\n      n200_gamma_rel_bias: 0.18\n      n200_theta_corr: 0.88\n      n200_ci_coverage_95: 0.85\n      growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 15\n      growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 10\n      minimum_n_for_gamma_significant: 80\n      minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal: 150\n    result_rationale: >\n      few-examinee regime在worst档下与信号质量问题叠加：\n      (1) N=20（现实中常见——很多benchmark只有20-50个models被评估）时，\n      γ RMSE 0.42，rel_bias 55%，θ与ground truth correlation仅0.58——\n      此时模型参数估计本质上是noise；\n      (2) Growing Pains pre-estimation策略（借用大pool的item参数先验）仅改善15%，\n      因为bottleneck不是item参数估计而是γ-θ的joint estimation——\n      item参数可以借用外部信息，但γ-θ的confounding是data-inherent的，无法靠先验缓解；\n      (3) 达到γ显著（即CI排除零）需要N≥80，达到nominal coverage需要N≥150——\n      这两个threshold在realistic benchmark evaluation scenarios中很难满足\n      （HELM有~100 models，但大部分benchmarks的evaluated model count远少于此）；\n      (4) 即使N=200，在worst档的信号质量下（AUC~0.65-0.70），\n      gamma_rel_bias仍有18%，coverage仅85%——仍未达到publishable quality。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Identifiability Metrics by Model Count (AUC=0.65)\"\n        columns: [N, gamma_RMSE, gamma_rel_bias, theta_corr, \"Coverage 95%\", \"Growing Pains Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [20, 0.42, \"55%\", 0.58, \"68%\", \"+15%\"]\n          - [50, 0.28, \"38%\", 0.72, \"75%\", \"+10%\"]\n          - [100, 0.18, \"25%\", 0.82, \"80%\", \"+5%\"]\n          - [200, 0.12, \"18%\", 0.88, \"85%\", \"+3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Identifiability surface — X: model count, Y: signal AUC, Z: γ relative bias (color-coded). Clear ridge at AUC≈0.70 below which no amount of models helps sufficiently. The 'green zone' (rel_bias<10%) requires AUC>0.80 AND N>100.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个仿真扩展与exp-004共同构成identifiability map的完整版本。\n      关键新发现：model count和signal AUC是multiplicative而非additive——\n      在AUC<0.70时，增加N的边际收益急剧递减（从N=100到N=200，改善仅7pp rel_bias）。\n      这意味着\"收集更多模型\"不是解决identifiability的viable path when signals are weak。\n      对论文：\"minimum signal quality targets for future work\"可以被具体化为AUC×N的joint requirement。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析。worst档下大模型的信号质量进一步下降，\n      confirm了scale-identifiability的inverse relationship。\n    expected_results:\n      signal_auc_embedding: 0.60\n      signal_auc_minkpp: 0.56\n      signal_auc_constat: 0.54\n      signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.58\n      rrf_auc: 0.59\n      gamma_estimate: 0.04\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      gamma_ci_width: 0.55\n      calibration_mae_pp: 11.2\n      ci_width_95_pp: 26.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B模型将scale问题推向极端：\n      (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎必然包含了benchmark items的某种形式——\n      不是传统意义的\"contamination\"而是\"知识覆盖\"，这使得所有detection signals的false positive rate极高，\n      embedding retrieval AUC降至0.60因为模型legitimately \"knows\" the content；\n      (2) γ estimate 0.04几乎为零，不是因为没有contamination而是因为unable to detect it——\n      信号noise完全淹没了any real signal；\n      (3) 11.2pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error，因为72B的行为与smaller models\n      系统性不同（different error patterns, different item difficulty ordering），\n      IRT的transferability across scales受到根本挑战。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [metric, Qwen-72B, Qwen-7B (controlled), Qwen-3B (controlled)]\n        rows:\n          - [Best signal AUC, 0.60, 0.66, 0.69]\n          - [RRF AUC, 0.59, 0.63, 0.67]\n          - [γ estimate, 0.04, 0.25, 0.34]\n          - [γ CI excludes zero, No, \"Marginal (50%)\", Yes]\n          - [Calibration MAE (pp), 11.2, 8.5, 7.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale vs signal AUC trend line from 0.5B to 72B. Clear monotonic decrease. Horizontal dashed line at AUC=0.70 crossed between 1.5B and 3B scale. 72B is deep in the 'unidentifiable' zone.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B结果是identifiability boundary story的natural endpoint：\n      在frontier model scale上，calibration方法论本身不适用，因为\"contamination\"和\"knowledge\"\n      在概念层面就难以区分。这是reframed论文的strong closing argument——\n      \"our identifiability analysis reveals that contamination-aware calibration faces\n      a fundamental scale barrier: the very models most in need of calibration\n      (large, widely trained) are precisely those where calibration is least feasible.\"\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models.\n      worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行。\n    expected_results:\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.64\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.58\n      two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.54\n      calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 10.8\n      calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 7.8\n      mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4_signal: 0.38\n      ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 25.2\n      ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.75\n      kendall_tau_2signal: 0.48\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      2-signal mode在worst档下是最差的配置：\n      (1) ConStat和Self-Critique恰好是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n      它们的fusion AUC 0.64远低于identifiability threshold 0.70；\n      (2) MAE增加38%（从7.8pp到10.8pp），符合worst档的two_signal_degraded_mae_increase_relative范围[0.35, 0.6]；\n      (3) Kendall τ降至0.48——低于0.5意味着calibrated rankings与true rankings的agreement\n      不比random好多少，calibration实际上在扰乱而非改善rankings；\n      (4) 72%的conditions下γ CI包含零，说明在closed-weight scenario下\n      contamination detection几乎完全不可行。\n      这是因为closed-weight模型不提供logits和embeddings，而这两个恰好是信号质量最高的信息源——\n      没有它们，剩余信号不足以支撑any meaningful calibration。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Gap\"\n        columns: [metric, 4-signal, 2-signal, degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF AUC (100%), 0.70, 0.64, \"-8.6%\"]\n          - [MAE (pp), 7.8, 10.8, \"+38%\"]\n          - [\"CI Width 95% (pp)\", 19.5, 25.2, \"+29%\"]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.62, 0.48, \"-23%\"]\n          - [\"Coverage 95%\", 0.78, 0.75, \"-3.8%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side calibration error distributions (4-signal vs 2-signal). 2-signal distribution shifted right with heavier tail. Overlap region highlighted — some conditions where 2-signal accidentally performs okay, but median is significantly worse.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal degraded mode的failure confirm了一个important practical constraint：\n      closed-weight models（GPT-4, Claude等）——恰好是most scrutinized for contamination——\n      是calibration最不可行的targets。\n      对reframed论文：identifiability map需要一个新维度——\"signal access level\"\n      (full access: 4 signals; closed-weight: 2 signals)，\n      2-signal在identifiability map上的viable region极小（仅AUC>0.80且N>150，现实中不存在）。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8f9f0462-7647-44aa-9636-a0c3415c7643","total_cost_usd":0.49759699999999996,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11462,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":16540,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11462,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16540,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11462},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6419,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006529,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16540,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11462,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.49106799999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"3fa07eb7-0dac-4e2e-a198-93b22ad036d6"}
